      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `6b0b24c022a6d84e248845cd6af1dac3d229b3ccadcdb305dccd3c931985dad0--criminal-courts-2024-25-cube-7-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ee5a3c7e4a67e0175040b8caf234b3bffa5f7a98b5073cf5c82e34732993b5c0 | missing |\n| \"Table 39\" | 829fe141a578c8714a507d5f77549746e9e7905deb6bb02c19eb78f78ef5869e | missing |\n| \"Table 40\" | 28ba1eca3edf3efe8612ddf5d12e1013f9279b6d2471be0edbd853d6b215e1be | missing |\n| \"Table 41\" | cfefeecd06a0d43352196084508461e179c3fd27e01fa57831581035388fe5b3 | missing |\n| \"Table 42\" | f6ce41dc1982499b280bd1ba5d62d640196787100a53477ef70775bed797c4e4 | missing |\n| \"Table 43\" | 5d0b8d8c9da7b7aa7118ac0e54d3062484ca70ff0eef8e17f3d5c3478357581e | missing |\n| \"Table 44\" | f7a78af5d761d8172f4f954561641469d53253953ff8af5ab9237e32176f7cef | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (3850350142e81f1a2988c32cb3c1d224ce3ba847773c20228cff065c8f635ba2). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
